  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Bosnia - Government Debt Issuance and Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Install debt management hardware and software in CBBH; assist MOFT in establishing DTS database; assist MOST and CBBH with implementation of the government securities market; develop debt management organization including identification of training needs; determine appropriate roles and responsibilities of debt management institutions; structure workout of old domestic debt; formulate national debt management strategy; assess possibility for a primary dealer system; assess integrity of primary market auction; assist in development of secondary market system; broaden investor participation; improve cash flow forecasting; help in quantifying and reporting BiH&apos;s internal and external debt and contingent liabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
